<title>USA: Modine names Savage as chairman, CEO.</title>
<headline>Modine names Savage as chairman, CEO.</headline>
<dateline>RACINE, Wis. 1996-10-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Modine Manufacturing Co said it promoted Richard Savage to chairman and chief executive officer. He previously was president and CEO.</p>
<p>The company also named executive vice president of operations Donald Johnson to the position of president and chief operating officer.</p>
<p>Modine makes auto heating and air-conditioning parts.</p>
<p>	   -- Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787</p>
</text>
